# Reflection classes not expected to be used directly
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingTypesProblem]("grpc.reflection.v1alpha.reflection.*")
ProblemFilters.exclude[IncompatibleTemplateDefProblem]("grpc.reflection.v1alpha.reflection.*")
# Internals
ProblemFilters.exclude[IncompatibleMethTypeProblem]("akka.grpc.internal.JavaMetadataImpl.getParsedDetails")
# TODO possibly problematic and not really safe to filter, this is public API, but deprecated method?
ProblemFilters.exclude[IncompatibleMethTypeProblem]("akka.grpc.javadsl.MetadataStatus.getParsedDetails")
ProblemFilters.exclude[ReversedMissingMethodProblem]("akka.grpc.javadsl.MetadataStatus.getParsedDetails")